# expect-error: call depth exceeded
# Unbounded recursion should surface a clean call-depth error instead of a generic "stack
# overflow". §16. The recursive call is not in tail position: a tail call reuses its frame, so
# `proc rec {n} { rec [+ $n 1] }` runs forever on a backend with tail calls (TEMEN) rather than
# testing the depth limit (#281).
proc rec {n} { + 1 [rec [+ $n 1]] }
rec 0
